<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The gift icon (uiscript/giftbox.py, uitaskbar.py GiftBox): the
	     present the item mall shows while a gift waits. Only the NovaUI
	     taskbar makes it, while the gift-box flag is on (controller:
	     assets/root/nui_gift_box.py); it shows on C++ Gift_Show and hides
	     when the player opens the mall. It takes no input, as legacy. Modern
	     draws a chip with a present drawn in code and a spark; classic
	     draws the legacy present art, a frame its overlay gives the frames
	     part, in the metin2_patch_etc group
	     (d:/ymir work/ui/pattern/giftbox/), a root for lint and snapshots. -->
	<title>gift-box</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="gift-box.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" class="nui-overlay nui-below-legacy-ui gift-box">
	<span id="gift-box" class="gift-box__icon"><nui-frames class="gift-box__frames"/><span class="gift-box__well"><span
		class="gift-box__bow gift-box__bow--l"></span><span class="gift-box__bow gift-box__bow--r"></span><span
		class="gift-box__lid"></span><span class="gift-box__box"></span><span class="gift-box__ribbon"></span><span
		class="gift-box__spark"><span class="gift-box__spark-v"></span><span class="gift-box__spark-h"></span></span></span></span>
</body>
</rml>
